<title>MALTA: Malta Treasury issues 91-day bills for $30 mln.</title>
<headline>Malta Treasury issues 91-day bills for $30 mln.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Malta Treasury on Friday issues 11.5 million Maltese pounds ($30 million) in 91-day treasury bills maturing on May 30, 1997.</p>
<p>They have a yield rate of 5.0052 percent per annum, unchanged from the previous 91-day issue of February 21, 1997.</p>
<p>($ = 0.38cents)</p>
